# Build outputs are COMMITTED on purpose, both of them.
#
# `cordis.patch.yml` points the loader at `./lib/index.js`, and a bundle listed
# in a profile's `dsh.profile.bundles` that cannot be imported fails the whole
# application boot — not just this plugin. An install that does not approve
# build scripts would leave that path missing, so both artifacts ship:
#
#   client/client.js  the browser bundle
#   lib/              the host entry
#
# `prepare` still rebuilds them when build scripts do run, so a checkout that
# builds is never behind. Run `npm run check` before committing a change under
# `src/`; it rebuilds both and then asserts their shape.
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
